with this work.

Apache OpenWhisk (https://openwhisk.apache.org/)
  A subset of the Apache OpenWhisk sources, taken unmodified from an earlier
  OpenWhisk release, is vendored under build/openwhisk. Apache OpenWhisk is
  licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See the NOTICE file for the
  required attribution.

Spray Caching 1.3.4 (io.spray:spray-caching_2.11:1.3.4)
  http://spray.io/documentation/1.2.4/spray-caching/
  The file
    build/openwhisk/common/scala/src/main/scala/org/apache/openwhisk/core/database/ConcurrentMapBackedCache.scala
  contains implementation derived from Spray's [[spray.caching.Cache]] and
  [[spray.caching.SimpleLruCache]]. Licensed under the Apache License,
  Version 2.0. The license text as distributed by the spray project is
  included at build/openwhisk/licenses/LICENSE-spray.txt, or see
  https://github.com/spray/spray/blob/master/LICENSE
  Copyright (C) 2011-2015 the spray project <http://spray.io>

Gradle wrapper v5.5
  The files build/openwhisk/gradlew and build/openwhisk/gradlew.bat are
  distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. For details see those
  files.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party Kubernetes manifests and configuration files
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The files listed below are copies of manifests and configuration files
published by third-party projects, in most cases rendered from the upstream
Helm chart or generated by the upstream operator build. Each copy carries an
ASF licence header added by this project; the content below that header is
the upstream work, reproduced unmodified or with minor local edits (names,
namespaces, image tags, tuning values). All of them are licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0.

