  Copyright The cert-manager Authors.
  The static installation manifest (cert-manager.yaml) from the upstream
  GitHub release, unmodified:
    oplugins-op/deploy/cert-manager/cert-manager.yaml           (v1.10.1)
    oplugins/cloud/aks/cert-manager.yaml                         (v1.11.0)
    oplugins/cloud/eks/cert-manager.yaml                         (v1.11.0)
    oplugins/cloud/gke/cert-manager.yaml                         (v1.11.0)
    oplugins/cloud/k3s/cert-manager.yaml                         (v1.11.0)

