      Copyright Broadcom.
    - minio-8.0.17, the MinIO Helm chart as redistributed by milvus-helm
      (originally published by MinIO, Inc. under the Apache License,
      Version 2.0, before MinIO's licence change). Only the chart templates
      are bundled; the MinIO server image referenced by them is not part of
      this distribution.

